  "bodyHash": "gZJUkeZNRVg=",
  "content": "<p>石英軍械庫是 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精緻儲存</a> 的附加模組，新增了多種工具。</p><p>目前新增項目：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fwireless-crafting-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">無線合成面板</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fcreative-wireless-crafting-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">創造模式無線合成面板</a></li>\n</ul><h2>無線合成面板</h2><p>無線合成面板是 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fviewing-resources%252fcrafting-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">合成面板</a> 的無線版本。</p><h3>使用方式</h3><p>使用無線合成面板：</p><ul>\n<li>在任何儲存網路裝置上使用，將其綁定至一個儲存網路。</li>\n<li>確保儲存網路中至少安裝一個 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fwireless-transmitter.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">無線發射器</a> 以建立連線。</li>\n<li>為無線合成面板充電，因為在開啟檢視、放入、取出或合成資源時會消耗能量。</li>\n</ul><h3>按鍵綁定</h3><p>提供一個未綁定的按鍵，可用於開啟無線合成面板。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
